{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act18d3_level_act18d3_09_end",
  "groupId": "act18d3",
  "stageId": "act18d3_09",
  "title": "篤信者",
  "storyCode": "SV-9",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "825f55da41e37106a4ae30b7a26a51d97e831180a83aa9cd157c89f3a092b872",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "四處都在漏水。了結它，我們得走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼你們這種瞎了眼睛的庸人能苟活？為什麼我這樣為事業投入了生命，專注於偉大目標的人......會失敗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "盲目、停止流動的阿戈爾拴著的寵物......你們對科學和未來......毫無助益！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已......幾近真理！為什麼我要死在這裡？！而你們......卻能逃脫你們應得的酷刑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我走了這麼遠，我的意志和肉體，都快要撕碎人類軀殼的束縛了！為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼？為什麼？！為什麼！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "閉嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿戈爾......必定毀滅。你們什麼都不剩......什麼都......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蠢材。我活著，我就是阿戈爾，我活著，阿戈爾就活著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你......但......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "諷刺......諷刺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是不一樣的。呼......你註定不同......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你很清楚。你的命運已定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要再廢話連篇了。請你乖乖死掉，對你我只剩下這個請求。我很真誠的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我詛咒你們......我要詛咒你們......直到陸地被淹沒......你們會像鹽粒一樣，逃出大海......最後還是被大海溶解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在你們屍骨堆砌的貧瘠荒原上，我們鼓動不歇的潮聲會在蒼白夜空下浸沒大陸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost#2",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "總算死了。這事情也算是結束了......我親手殺了它。沒我想像裡那樣令人高興。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost#2",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "比起他們對我做的這些，真是太輕了。殺了一個，還有兩個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost#2",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "呃，頭又有點暈了。我是怎麼過來的？簡直就像一直在做夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鯊魚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost#2",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "畢竟......沒法一直醒著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們抓到了他們的觸手，現在順著摸過去，把他們連根拔起，一定能找到治好你的辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost#2",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "沒事。現在它們控制不了我，我感覺很好。自由的感覺......竟然是在這時候。我快飄起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost#2",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "但是，隊長，你們說的我都聽到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost#2",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "它是說我們也會變成海嗣？隊長，你會變成特別厲害的那種？還挺強的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不會的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你和它們可太不一樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "希望我沒有因為自己的獨斷專行而害了你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "回答我幾個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我有問必答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們體內流著海嗣的血？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你來這裡是為了確認幽靈鯊身體問題的原因。你之所以要吃那一下是為了知道為什麼海嗣想找我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你早就知道這裡不止主教一隻海嗣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道我們那場自殺一樣的決戰的最後，我做了什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們贏了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也不知道。我與阿戈爾失去了聯繫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我們是不是阿戈爾的棄子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行了。走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost#2",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "真爽快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒什麼好磨蹭的。我畢竟是個深海獵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......難道二隊的人不這樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "深海獵人都這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡快塌了，而且......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost#3",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "嘁，太多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost#3",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "斯卡蒂！拿出點力氣來！這裡就只剩你胳膊腿都沒破皮了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還要怎樣......我手都撕麻了。你上次用手伸進它們的嘴把它們撕成兩半是什麼時候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三秒前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剛剛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不行。只要那具身體還在那......恐魚就不會停。它在呼喚它們。那是個錨！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost#3",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "得毀掉那具屍體才行......填埋可不夠......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost#2",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "就憑你這破了個大洞的身子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們可以——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "獵人們，快走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼是你？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "之後再說！Mon3tr，去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
